208 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 90 0 R/T(My previous ramble highlighted the step 5 clubs left in the FA Cup at the third qualifying stage - Barton Town the sole representative left from the NCEFL went out to National North side Chorley - Tadley Calleva from the Cherry Red Records Combined Counties Football League knocked out Isthmian Premier Division \(Step 3\) side Dartford FC coming back from a goal down to score twice in the last 15 minutes and they now face a trip to National League side Aldershot Town in the fourth qualifying round - SE Dons also had an excellent victory in beating Southern League Division 1 South \(Step 4\) side Weymouth FC 5-1 and they also face an away trip to Southern League Premier Division South \(step 3\) side Sholing FC.)/E(My previous ramble highlighted the step 5 clubs left in the FA Cup at the third qualifying stage - Barton Town the sole representative left from the NCEFL went out to National North side Chorley - Tadley Calleva from the Cherry Red Records Combined Counties Football League knocked out Isthmian Premier Division \(Step 3\) side Dartford FC coming back from a goal down to score twice in the last 15 minutes and they now face a trip to National League side Aldershot Town in the fourth qualifying round - SE Dons also had an excellent victory in beating Southern League Division 1 South \(Step 4\) side Weymouth FC 5-1 and they also face an away trip to Southern League Premier Division South \(step 3\) side Sholing FC.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

209 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 90 0 R/E(The other two clubs to have changed managers are Crowle Colts and Club Thorne Colliery, interesting one here Gav Cooper and his assistant Ben Simpson departed Crowle Colts one day and the next were appointed at Club Thorne Colliery with Grant Black being appointed to replace then at Crowle - Black has previously managed at Brighouse Town, Ossett United and Belper United, and the other club to have a new manager is Wakefield AFC with Adam Lockwood replacing Jaso Blunt - Lockwood has previously managed at Wakefield and Blunt was appointed manager of NPL East side Stocksbridge Park steels last week.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 90 0 R/E(There you are Managerial Merry go round!! )/Pg 20 0 R/K[2]>>
