340 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 99 0 R/E(The club was founded in 1982 as a youth team for the Rotherham area. In 2018 an adult side was formed and joined Division One of the Doncaster Senior League. After finishing third in their first season in the league, the club were promoted to the Senior Division. In 2021 they transferred to the North Division of the Central Midlands League.They were North Division runners-up in 2022\20523, and after the league merged with the Midlands Regional Alliance, they were placed in the Premier North Division.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[2 464 0 R 4 465 0 R 6]>>
endobj

